Z||000001||artherd||12-06-2001||11:44 PM||||Engine or full car?  You just missed getting jay's car for a steal.<P>Engine wise, they're pretty cheap.  You can get a good extreemly low-miles motor for about $2,500.00.  Look on ebay of all places.<P>They're an awesome motor for our cars, in my opinion *THE* best!  <P>I mean, the darn thing will make over 450bhp with $2k in mods, and it *BOLTS UP* to the Getrag!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
